  "reasoning": "The defendant Liu organized the procurement and distribution of weight‑loss products that lacked production licenses, had no production dates, quality certificates, or manufacturers – i.e., \"three‑no\" products. He sold these unqualified drugs as if they were legitimate, with a total value exceeding 20,000 yuan but less than 500,000 yuan. Under Article 141 of the Criminal Law, this constitutes the crime of producing and selling counterfeit (or unqualified) drugs (生产、销售假药罪). No other facts (e.g., fraud, theft, forgery, drug manufacturing, or concealment) are present, so the only appropriate charge is production and sale of counterfeit drugs.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]生产、销售假药罪<eoa>"
}
